// 289's book (general/scripts/book.rs2) on 2011's two-page book, book (959;
// cache 786: title com5, eleven lines a page, com30-40 and com41-51, 177 wide
// in q8_full; a model before each line, com6-16 and com17-27; Back com28 and
// Next com29; page numbers com52 and com53; Close com4), named here as 289's
// book components are. 289 shows an obj by a line in a hidden layer
// (page_left_index_1 ...) around its model; 2011's models stand alone, so
// each is hidden or shown itself.

// 2011's page numbers, as void-634 writes them (BookPages.kt: the left page
// %book_page * 2 + 1, the right one more); 289's book has none.
[proc,book_page_numbers]
if_settext(book_small:pagenum_left, tostring(add(multiply(%book_page, 2), 1)));
if_settext(book_small:pagenum_right, tostring(add(multiply(%book_page, 2), 2)));

[if_button,book_small:close_btn]
if_close();

